OL,3,GNEWSACatching scabies in hospital meant
OL,4,Amy husband was labelled an
OL,5,Aenvironmental hazard when he died
OL,6,
OL,7,FAs her husband of more than 40 years
OL,8,Flay dying in a hospital bed, Kate
OL,9,FBaxter was not even allowed to hold his
OL,10,Fhand without wearing protective gloves.
OL,12,FPaul suffered a stroke in December 2025
OL,13,Fand, four months before he died in June
OL,14,Faged 90, caught scabies in hospital.
OL,16,FIn his final days, Kate could only
OL,17,Ftouch him while wearing the rubber
OL,18,Fgloves after he contracted the highly
OL,19,Fcontagious skin infestation at
OL,20,FGlangwili Hospital, Carmarthen.
