OL,3,GNEWSACatching scabies in hospital meant
OL,4,Amy husband was labelled an
OL,5,Aenvironmental hazard when he died
OL,6,
OL,7,FHywel Dda health board said it was
OL,8,Ftaking extra measures to control the
OL,9,Fspread of scabies and was focused on
OL,10,Fkeeping hospitals and healthcare
OL,11,Fsettings as clean as possible.
